      "description": "只调整普通武器伤害；必杀沿用原规则，不获得王牌专属伤害倍率。",
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 100,
      "minimum": 1,
      "maximum": 1000,
      "file": "config.ini",
      "section": "settings",
